# URLC Research Proposal Management System — Full System Report

## 1. System Overview

The **URLC System** is a **Role-Based Research Proposal Management System** built with **Laravel 8 (Breeze)**. It allows researchers to submit, track, and revise research proposals, while reviewers evaluate them and admins make final decisions.

> [!NOTE]
> Base URL: `http://localhost:8000` (via `php artisan serve`)
> Database: MySQL (`urlc_system`) on `127.0.0.1:3306`

