## 7. Proposal Workflow & Status Lifecycle

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: Researcher submits
    pending --> approved: Reviewer approves
    pending --> rejected: Reviewer rejects
    pending --> revision_required: Reviewer requests revision
    revision_required --> pending: Researcher resubmits
    approved --> final_approved: Admin final approve
    approved --> final_rejected: Admin final reject
    rejected --> final_approved: Admin overrides
    rejected --> final_rejected: Admin confirms
    final_approved --> [*]
    final_rejected --> [*]
```

### Status Values

| Status | Badge Color | Set By | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `pending` | Gray | System/Researcher | Initial state or resubmitted |
| `approved` | Green | Reviewer | Reviewer approves proposal |
| `rejected` | Red | Reviewer | Reviewer rejects proposal |
| `revision_required` | Yellow | Reviewer | Reviewer requests changes |
| `final_approved` | Blue | Admin | Admin gives final approval |
| `final_rejected` | Dark | Admin | Admin gives final rejection |

