## 8. Controller Logic Summary

### [ResearchProposalController.php](file:///c:/Users/andre/urlc-system/app/Http/Controllers/ResearchProposalController.php)

| Method | Role | Logic |
|---|---|---|
| `index()` | Researcher | Fetches proposals where `user_id == auth()->id()` |
| `create()` | Researcher | Returns the create proposal form |
| `store()` | Researcher | Validates input, stores PDF to `documents/` disk, creates proposal with status `pending` |
| `edit($id)` | Researcher | Only allows editing if `status == 'revision_required'` AND owned by user |
| `update($id)` | Researcher | Only allows update if `status == 'revision_required'`, resets status to `pending` |
| `reviewerIndex()` | Reviewer | Fetches ALL proposals with eager-loaded `user` relation |
| `updateStatus($id)` | Reviewer | Updates `status`, `review_comments`, `review_suggestions` |
| `adminIndex()` | Admin | Fetches ALL proposals with eager-loaded `user` relation |
| `adminFinalDecision($id)` | Admin | Sets status to `final_approved` or `final_rejected` only |

### Validation Rules

| Field | Create | Update |
|---|---|---|
| `title` | required | required |
| `abstract` | required | required |
| `research_field` | nullable, string | nullable, string |
| `budget_requested` | required, numeric | required, numeric |
| `document` | required, PDF, max 20MB | nullable, PDF, max 20MB |

