## 11. Registration & Default Role

New users registered via `/register` are **automatically assigned the `researcher` role** via the database migration default:

```php
$table->string('role')->default('researcher');
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> There is **no role selection** on the registration form. To create `admin` or `reviewer` accounts, you must manually update the `role` column in the `users` table via database (phpMyAdmin or Tinker).

---

## 12. File Upload Handling

- **Storage disk**: `public` (files stored in `storage/app/public/documents/`)
- **Accepted format**: PDF only (`mimes:pdf`)
- **Max size**: 20 MB (`max:20480`)
- **Access URL**: `asset('storage/' . $proposal->document_path)`

> [!WARNING]
> You must run `php artisan storage:link` to create the symbolic link from `public/storage` to `storage/app/public`, otherwise uploaded documents will not be accessible via the browser.

