## 13. Security Features

| Feature | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Authentication** | Laravel Breeze (session-based) |
| **CSRF Protection** | `@csrf` on all forms, `VerifyCsrfToken` middleware |
| **Role-Based Access** | Custom `RoleMiddleware` checking `auth()->user()->role` |
| **Ownership Guard** | `edit()` and `update()` verify `user_id == auth()->id()` |
| **Status Guard** | Edit/update only allowed when `status == 'revision_required'` |
| **Password Hashing** | `Hash::make()` via Breeze |
| **Input Validation** | Server-side validation on all form submissions |
| **File Validation** | Only PDF, max 20MB |

